#: data/photos.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Photos is an easy-to-use, fast photo organizer. It allows you to import "
"photos from your camera or disk, organize them by date and subject matter, "
"even ratings. It also offers basic photo editing, like crop, red-eye "
"correction, color adjustments, and straighten. Photos' non-destructive photo "
"editor does not alter your master photos, making it easy to experiment and "
"correct errors."
msgstr ""

#: data/photos.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Photos supports JPEG, PNG, TIFF, and a variety of RAW file formats."
